{"id":"b868c3cedde4d2f8","group":"56","path":"56/56-thm-strong-convergence-countable.md","title":"强收敛归约长度可数","display":"thm-strong-convergence-countable — 强收敛归约长度可数","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-thm-strong-convergence-countable","aliases":["56-thm-strong-convergence-countable"],"display":"thm-strong-convergence-countable — 强收敛归约长度可数","depends_on":["[[56-df-strongly-convergent]]"],"source_reference":"Terese (2003), Exercise 12.3.6 and Proposition 12.3.7, printed p675","source_ocr_block":"696","verification_status":"source-statement-compared; local-proof-reviewed"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-thm-strong-convergence-countable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-thm-strong-convergence-countable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-strong-convergence-countable — 强收敛归约长度可数"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"9cbbb9f968fe8087\" href=\"?note=9cbbb9f968fe8087\" title=\"56-df-strongly-convergent\">56-df-strongly-convergent</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), Exercise 12.3.6 and Proposition 12.3.7, printed p675"},{"key":"source_ocr_block","html":"696"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-compared; local-proof-reviewed"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\">\\(\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9cbbb9f968fe8087\" href=\"?note=9cbbb9f968fe8087\" title=\"56-df-strongly-convergent\">56-df-strongly-convergent</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 为步数序数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p_\\beta\">\\(p_\\beta\\)</span> 为每一步归约位置。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 表示可数无限基数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl|\\{\\beta&lt;\\alpha:|p_\\beta|&lt;k\\}\\bigr|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\qquad|\\alpha|\\le\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl|\\{\\beta&lt;\\alpha:|p_\\beta|&lt;k\\}\\bigr|&lt;\\aleph_0,\\qquad|\\alpha|\\le\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Exercise 12.3.6 与 Proposition 12.3.7（印刷 p675，OCR 页块696）。本地推导：若某个有限深度界下有无限多个归约步，取严格递增的 ω 子序列，其上确界是一个不超过 α 的非零极限序数，违反该极限处深度趋于无穷。每一步位置深度有限，步索引集合是可数个有限集合之并，因而可数。这里证明了强收敛⇒有限浅层步⇒可数长度，未冒称单凭深度条件即可补足任意项序列的极限存在性。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-strongly-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-strongly-convergent]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-strongly-convergent","status":"resolved","id":"9cbbb9f968fe8087","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"给定 $\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)$，见 [[56-df-strongly-convergent]]。$\\alpha$ 为步数序数，$p_\\beta$ 为每一步归约位置。$\\aleph_0$ 表示可数无限基数。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{StrongConv}_R(\\mathbf t,\\mathbf p,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"p_\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl|\\{\\beta<\\alpha:|p_\\beta|<k\\}\\bigr|<\\aleph_0,\\qquad|\\alpha|\\le\\aleph_0.","display":true}],"bytes":1422,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-312","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-thm-strong-convergence-countable.md]]"}],"outgoing":["9cbbb9f968fe8087"]}